1. go to cloudflare zero trust.
2. Networks/Connectors
3. either create a new tunnel or on your existing tunnel "Add a connector"
4. delete all content in this file and only paste the token. string you copy from cloudflare will look something like "cloudflared.exe service install eyJhIjoiMTd" or if you generate a docker string "docker run cloudflare/cloudflared:latest tunnel --no-autoupdate run --token eyJhIjoiMTd" only take the token at the end and paste it into this file. all other